WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.593
In tutorial 6.8, you'll answer
the questions on a written page,

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:13.484
so it says exactly what is
true about your business.

00:00:14.525 --> 00:00:17.950
First, open Content. A page that is Ready,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.725
stronger with your input
has questions for you.

00:00:20.775 --> 00:00:22.351
Click Answer the questions.

00:00:23.341 --> 00:00:28.041
The page is publishable without your
answers, but each one makes it more specific.

00:00:28.091 --> 00:00:29.666
These 3 matter most.

00:00:30.824 --> 00:00:35.097
Each question shows what we wanted to
say, and what the page says for now.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:42.045
Some answers are already on your
website. Click Accept all suggestions,

00:00:42.095 --> 00:00:44.669
and they move to Answered
in your business details.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:50.105
Then answer the rest. Yes, keep
it uses our sentence as it is.

00:00:50.155 --> 00:00:53.208
You can also edit it, remove
it, or leave it general.

00:00:54.366 --> 00:00:58.721
For the price, click Leave it general,
and the page keeps general words.

00:00:58.771 --> 00:01:01.486
Your answers are kept
for your later pages too.

00:01:02.888 --> 00:01:06.388
To change any wording yourself,
click Open the editor.

00:01:06.438 --> 00:01:09.442
Edit a paragraph, and the
preview shows it right away.

00:01:11.345 --> 00:01:14.595
Then click Save my version.
Your version is checked,

00:01:14.645 --> 00:01:17.154
and Compare shows
exactly what you changed.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:23.770
Now click Make the final version. Your
answers and edits go into the page,

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:27.800
and the whole page is checked
again. Click Make it for 6 credits.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:34.070
When the final version is ready, click
Approve the final version and publish.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:36.456
It's approved, with
your name and the date.

00:01:37.845 --> 00:01:42.012
So the page you publish says what is true
about your business, in your own words.

00:01:43.866 --> 00:01:48.861
So, open the questions, read the ones
that matter most, accept the suggestions,

00:01:48.911 --> 00:01:53.041
answer the rest, change the page
yourself, and make the final version.

00:01:54.024 --> 00:02:00.047
Your page is ready to publish. Next, read
your website overview, in tutorial 7.1.
